{"seq":1,"slug":"deng-xiaoping-thought-overview","title":"邓小平理论体系","stage":"DONE","category":"deng-xiaoping-theory","categoryLabel":"邓小平理论","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/02_deng-xiaoping-theory/01_deng-xiaoping-thought-overview","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"邓小平理论体系-简介\">邓小平理论体系 简介</h1><p>本 hub 是&quot;邓小平理论&quot;合集的<strong>总入口与概览</strong>。它的定位是：用最短的路径让读者建立起对邓小平理论的整体认知框架——时代背景、核心思想、理论体系三块拼图——再据此决定深入哪个专题。它<strong>不追求穷尽细节</strong>，细节由合集中的其他专题 hub 承担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 围绕&quot;什么是社会主义、怎样建设社会主义&quot;这一根本问题，提供三层概览：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时代背景与历史条件</strong>——理论诞生的国内外环境与邓小平个人轨迹，回答&quot;为什么是这个时候、这个人&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>——解放思想、实事求是、猫论三大思想内核，回答&quot;思想方法是什么&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>理论体系</strong>——四项基本原则、社会主义初级阶段、两手抓三大支柱，回答&quot;理论骨架是什么&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>凡是需要展开到政策、文献、专项理论层面的内容，本 hub <strong>只做指引、不做深挖</strong>，交给下表中的兄弟 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>你想了解的内容</th>\n<th>去哪个 hub</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整体框架、入门概览（你在这里）</td>\n<td>本 hub</td>\n<td>总入口，先读这里建立坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原始文献、原文出处</td>\n<td><a href=\"../selected-works-of-deng/\">邓小平文选</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 提炼观点，它提供原文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改革开放的决策与政策细节</td>\n<td><a href=\"../reform-and-opening-up/\">改革开放</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲思想，它讲实践落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;中国特色社会主义&quot;的制度展开</td>\n<td><a href=\"../socialism-with-chinese-characteristics/\">中国特色社会主义</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 给概念，它给制度设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1992 年南巡的专题</td>\n<td><a href=\"../southern-tour-talks/\">南方谈话</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 一笔带过，它逐句深读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>港澳回归与统一方略</td>\n<td><a href=\"../one-country-two-systems/\">一国两制</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 不涉及，专题独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计划与市场、市场经济理论</td>\n<td><a href=\"../socialist-market-economy-theory/\">社会主义市场经济理论</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 提及，它系统建模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>思想方法的方法论提炼</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-methodology/\">邓小平方法论</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 讲&quot;是什么&quot;，它讲&quot;怎么用&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外交思想</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-foreign-policy/\">邓小平外交思想</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 不涉及，专题独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史地位与当代影响</td>\n<td><a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-legacy/\">邓小平遗产与当代影响</a></td>\n<td>本 hub 不评价，它做长程评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 是地图，兄弟 hub 是目的地</strong>。先在这里看清全局，再按需求跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p><strong>入门者 / 第一次接触</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>读本 hub 三章，按&quot;时代背景 → 核心思想 → 理论体系&quot;顺序通读一遍，建立整体感。</li>\n<li>重点体会<a href=\"core-ideas/emancipate-mind\">解放思想</a>与<a href=\"core-ideas/seeking-truth\">实事求是</a>的辩证关系——这是理解全部内容的钥匙。</li>\n<li>再跳到<a href=\"../reform-and-opening-up/\">改革开放</a>看思想如何变成实践。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>政治学 / 历史学研究者</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>从<a href=\"historical-context/political-career\">邓小平的政治生涯</a>切入，把握&quot;三落三起&quot;与制度变迁的互动。</li>\n<li>精读<a href=\"theoretical-system/four-cardinal-principles\">四项基本原则</a>与<a href=\"theoretical-system/primary-stage-socialism\">社会主义初级阶段理论</a>，理解理论骨架。</li>\n<li>转入<a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-methodology/\">邓小平方法论</a>与<a href=\"../deng-xiaoping-legacy/\">邓小平遗产</a>做深度与评价。</li>\n<li>以<a href=\"../selected-works-of-deng/\">邓小平文选</a>原文相互印证。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>关注改革开放经济逻辑的读者</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先读本 hub<a href=\"core-ideas/cat-theory\">猫论</a>与<a href=\"theoretical-system/primary-stage-socialism\">社会主义初级阶段理论</a>。</li>\n<li>直接进入<a href=\"../socialist-market-economy-theory/\">社会主义市场经济理论</a>与<a href=\"../southern-tour-talks/\">南方谈话</a>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>阅读本 hub 不要求专业背景，但具备以下基础会理解得更顺畅：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>马克思主义基本原理</strong>：尤其是<a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/epistemology-methodology/practice-cognition\">实践与认识</a>与<a href=\"../../../marxism/marxism-fundamentals/historical-materialism/productive-forces-relations\">生产力与生产关系</a>，是理解&quot;实事求是&quot;&quot;初级阶段&quot;的理论底座。</li>\n<li><strong>中国近现代史</strong>：了解<a href=\"../../../history/chinese-history/modern-china/anti-japanese-war\">抗日战争</a>、<a href=\"../../../history/chinese-history/modern-china/liberation-war\">解放战争</a>与&quot;文化大革命&quot;，有助于把握理论诞生的历史脉络。</li>\n<li><strong>基础经济学常识</strong>：知道<a href=\"../../../economics-finance/economics-thinking/macroeconomics/gdp-and-growth\">GDP 与经济增长</a>的基本概念，便于理解&quot;以经济建设为中心&quot;的判断依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>毛泽东思想是邓小平理论的直接前身，读完本 hub 后可与<a href=\"../../mao-zedong-studies/mao-zedong-thought/theoretical-formation/thought-formation-development\">毛泽东思想</a>对照，理解二者的继承与发展关系。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-context","title":"时代背景与历史条件","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/historical-context","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"era-background","title":"邓小平理论的时代背景","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/historical-context/era-background"},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-life-revolution","title":"邓小平早期革命生涯","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/historical-context/early-life-revolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"political-career","title":"邓小平的政治生涯","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/historical-context/political-career"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-ideas","title":"核心思想","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/core-ideas","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emancipate-mind","title":"解放思想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/core-ideas/emancipate-mind"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seeking-truth","title":"实事求是","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/core-ideas/seeking-truth"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cat-theory","title":"猫论——实用主义哲学的中国表达","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/core-ideas/cat-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"theoretical-system","title":"理论体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/theoretical-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"four-cardinal-principles","title":"四项基本原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/theoretical-system/four-cardinal-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"primary-stage-socialism","title":"社会主义初级阶段理论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/theoretical-system/primary-stage-socialism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"two-hands-strategy","title":"两手抓两手都要硬","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/deng-xiaoping-theory/deng-xiaoping-thought-overview/theoretical-system/two-hands-strategy"}]}]}